Nethack's werecreatures may be in either form at any phase of the moon.
They are much more likely to transform to beast form at full moon, but
may do so at any time.

Nethack uses broadly quantised values of the phase of the moon; both
full moon and new moon last approximately four days.

New moon isn't *that* much more dangerous than normal; the only effect
of new moon that I can find is very specific (footrice touches are
vastly more likely to stone you, unless you are carrying a lizard
corpse).

Full moon gives you +1 luck, but makes werefoo more likely to be bestial
and (at night) makes dogs harder to tame with food.
